(4535, 427, 'faq_5_content', 'The answer is No! '),
(4536, 427, '_faq_5_content', 'field_694a4515c9858'),
(4537, 427, 'faq_6_content', 'Yes, we can ship anywhere in the US.  We have shipped tactical items of all types throughout the US.    It is important to note that ALL firearms must be shipped to a federal firearms license (FFL) dealer.  If you do not already have one in your area just ask us, we have a couple thousand on file that we have shipped to previously.'),
(4538, 427, '_faq_6_content', 'field_694a4517c9859'),
(4539, 427, 'faq_7_content', 'Federal Firearms License.'),
(4540, 427, '_faq_7_content', 'field_694a4518c985a'),
(4541, 427, 'faq_8_content', 'You must be 21 years of age to purchase a handgun or receiver, 18 years of age to purchase a long gun from Mata\'s Tactical Supply. '),
(4542, 427, '_faq_8_content', 'field_694a451ac985b'),
(4543, 427, 'faq_9_content', 'A webinar is an online event that is hosted by Mata’s Tactical Supply and then broadcast via the internet to the group of individuals that pay to watch the webinar.  The thing that sets us apart is that when the webinar is concluded one of the individuals who has paid to watch will be selected at random to win the item discussed in the webinar.'),
(4544, 427, '_faq_9_content', 'field_694a451cc985c'),
(4545, 427, 'faq_10_content', 'You will receive an email from Mata’s Tactical Supply depending on your preferred method of communication.  If this is your first time to receive an item from us, we will walk you through the steps and answer any questions you might have.      If the webinar was a firearm, we will need your FFL’s contact information and a copy of their license.  They can email a copy of their license to: ffl@matastacticalsupply.com, we just ask that your name be in the subject line.    If your item was not a firearm and does not require FFL transfer it will be shipped to the shipping address in your online profile.    Your item (regardless of the type) will then be packaged and shipped within 72 hours unless you are notified otherwise.  We do not charge additional fees but you should know that most FFLs charge a transfer fee so ask them before you have your item shipped there.'),
(4546, 427, '_faq_10_content', 'field_694a451ec985d'),
(4547, 427, 'faq_11_content', 'Firearms are NEVER shipped to someone’s home.  All firearms are shipped to an FFL per ATF regulations.  If your item is a non-firearm it will be shipped to the address you provide.  We ship via the USPS, FEDEx and UPS so please make sure that they will deliver to the address you provide.'),
(4548, 427, '_faq_11_content', 'field_694a4520c985e'),
(4549, 427, 'faq_12_content', 'Text and/or email notifications will be sent out a few minutes prior to the webinar going LIVE.  Only those who have purchased seats will be able to watch the webinar.  If you miss watching the LIVE webinar don’t worry, all webinars will be archived and can be viewed at your convenience. All webinar videos are saved in your account history. '),
(4550, 427, '_faq_12_content', 'field_694a4524c9860'),
