-100x100.png\" class=\"attachment-48x48 size-48x48 skip-lazy no-lazyload lazyload-disabled no-lazy skip-lazyload\" alt=\"Demo webinar - Seat\" loading=\"lazy\" data-skip-lazy=\"true\" style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; height: auto; outline: none; text-decoration: none; text-transform: capitalize; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 24px; max-width: 100%;\" border=\"0\"></td>						<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); padding-bottom: 24px; border: 0; padding: 0;\">\n							Demo webinar - Seat<div class=\"email-order-item-meta\" style=\"color: #111; font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%;\"><span>Seat(s):</span> 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 12</div>						</td>\n					</tr>\n				</table>\n						</td>\n		<td class=\"td font-family text-align-right\" style=\'color: #414141; border: 0; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; text-align: right; padding: 8px 12px; vertical-align: middle;\' align=\"right\">\n			×6		</td>\n		<td class=\"td font-family text-align-right\" style=\'color: #414141; border: 0; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; text-align: right; padding: 8px 12px; padding-right: 0; vertical-align: middle;\' align=\"right\">\n			<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">$</span>60.00</span>		</td>\n	</tr>\n	\n	<tr class=\"order_item\">\n		<td class=\"td font-family text-align-left\" style=\'color: #414141; border: 0; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; text-align: left; padding: 8px 12px; padding-left: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); padding-bottom: 24px; vertical-align: middle; word-wrap: break-word;\' align=\"left\">\n							<table class=\"order-item-data\" style=\'color: #111; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;\'>\n					<tr>\n						<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); padding-bottom: 24px; border: 0; padding: 0;\"><img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/tactical-gear-equipment-100x100.png\" class=\"attachment-48x48 size-48x48 skip-lazy no-lazyload lazyload-disabled no-lazy skip-lazyload\" alt=\"TACTICAL GEAR SELECTION - Seat\" loading=\"lazy\" data-skip-lazy=\"true\" style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; height: auto; outline: none; text-decoration: none; text-transform: capitalize; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 24px; max-width: 100%;\" border=\"0\"></td>						<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; padding-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); padding-bottom: 24px; border: 0; padding: 0;\">\n							TACTICAL GEAR SELECTION - Seat<div class=\"email-order-item-meta\" style=\"color: #111; font-size: 14px; line-height: 140%;\"><span>Seat(s):</span> 1, 2, 3, 4, 5</div>						</td>\n					</tr>\n				</table>\n						</td>\n		<td class=\"td font-family text-align-right\" style=\'color: #414141; border: 0; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; text-align: right; padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); padding-bottom: 24px; vertical-align: middle;\' align=\"right\">\n			×5		</td>\n		<td class=\"td font-family text-align-right\" style=\'color: #414141; border: 0; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; text-align: right; padding: 8px 12px; padding-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); padding-bottom: 24px; vertical-align: middle;\' align=\"right\">\n			<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">$</span>124.95</span>		</td>\n	</tr>\n	\n		</tbody>\n		<tfoot>\n								<tr class=\"order-totals order-totals-subtotal\">\n						<th class=\"td text-align-left\" scope=\"row\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"color: #414141; border: 0; vertical-align: mi