&utm_medium=free_email&utm_campaign=wpal-text-footer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #E5EFB0;\">WP Activity Log</a> is developed and maintained by <a href=\"https://melapress.com/#utm_source=wpal_email&utm_medium=free_email&utm_campaign=melapress-text-footer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #E5EFB0;\">Melapress</a>.<br><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Melapress Blaak 520 Rotterdam,</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Zuid-Holland 3011 TA Netherlands</span>\n								</td>\n							</tr>\n						</table>\n					</td>\n				</tr>\n			</table>\n			<!-- Footer End --></body></html>', 'Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8', '', 'Could not instantiate mail function.', '1.15.0');
