\">\n						<a href=\"https://melapress.com/#utm_source=wpal_email&utm_medium=free_email&utm_campaign=logo-footer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-security-audit-log/img/mails/daily-notification/melapress-icon.png\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" border=\"0\" style=\"display: block;\" alt=\"Melapress\"/></a>\n					</td>\n				</tr>\n				<tr>\n					<td align=\"center\" style=\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'Lucida Grande\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; color: #ffffff; padding-top: 25px;\" class=\"footer-text\">\n						If you\'re finding WP Activity Log helpful, consider trying our other plugins:<br> <a href=\" https://melapress.com/wordpress-2fa/#utm_source=wpal_email&utm_medium=free_email&utm_campaign=wp2fa-text-footer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\">WP 2FA</a> and <a href=\"https://melapress.com/wordpress-login-security/#utm_source=wpal_email&utm_medium=free_email&utm_campaign=mls-text-footer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Melapress Login Security</a>.\n					</td>\n				</tr>\n				<tr>\n					<td width=\"100%\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 16px 0 16px;\">\n						<table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\n							<tr>\n								<td align=\"center\" style=\"font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, \'Lucida Grande\', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px; color: #E5EFB0; padding-top: 25px;\" class=\"footer-text\">\n									This email is generated by WP Activity Log. To disable this daily overview navigate to the <a href=\"https://ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=wsal-notifications#wsal-options-tab-notifications-highlights\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #E5EFB0;\">email notifications settings</a><br><br>\n									<a href=\"https://melapress.com/wordpress-activity-log/#utm_source=wpal_email&utm_medium=free_email&utm_campaign=wpal-text-footer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #E5EFB0;\">WP Activity Log</a> is developed and maintained by <a href=\"https://melapress.com/#utm_source=wpal_email&utm_medium=free_email&utm_campaign=melapress-text-footer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #E5EFB0;\">Melapress</a>.<br><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Melapress Blaak 520 Rotterdam,</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Zuid-Holland 3011 TA Netherlands</span>\n								</td>\n							</tr>\n						</table>\n					</td>\n				</tr>\n			</table>\n			<!-- Footer End --></body></html>', 'Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8', '', 'Could not instantiate mail function.', '1.15.0'),
(59, '2026-02-03 10:34:36', '2a02:4780:b:656:0:cf7:2e93:9', 'roy.sawan@gmail.com', '[Matas Tactical Supply] Your Site is Experiencing a Technical Issue', 'Howdy!\n\nWordPress has a built-in feature that detects when a plugin or theme causes a fatal error on your site, and notifies you with this automated email.\n\nIn this case, WordPress caught an error with your theme, Matas Theme.\n\nFirst, visit your website (https://ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/) and check for any visible issues. Next, visit the page where the error was caught (https://ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php) and check for any visible issues.\n\nPlease contact your host for assistance with investigating this issue further.\n\nIf your site appears broken and you can\'t access your dashboard normally, WordPress now has a special \"recovery mode\". This lets you safely login to your dashboard and investigate further.\n\nhttps://ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/wp-login.php?action=enter_recovery_mode&rm_token=FRSCIa2PK4l7l6XqFMR45c&rm_key=kD4iIej6gM0ZYb2uvghwEq\n\nTo keep your site safe, this link will expire in 1 day. Don\'t worry about that, though: a new link will be emailed to you if the error occurs again after it expires.\n\nWhen seeking help with this issue, you may be asked for some of the following information:\nWordPress version 6.8.3\r\nActive theme: Matas Theme (version 2.1)\r\nCurrent plugin:  (version )\r\nPHP version 8.2.28\n\n\n\nError Details\n=============\nAn error of type E_PARSE was caused in line 493 of the file /home/u217525907/domains/ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/public_html/wp-content/themes/matas/functions.php. Error message: Unmatched \'}\'', 'Content-Type: text/html', '', 'Could not instantiate mail function.', '1.15.0'),
(60, '2026-02-03 11:18:04', '2a02:4780:b:656:0:cf7:2e93:9', 'positivevibesforall94@gmail.com', 'Your Matas Tactical Supply account has been created!', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-US\">\n	<head>\n		<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n		<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\">\n		<title>Matas Tactical Supply</title>\n	<style type=\"text/css\">@media screen and (max-width: 600px){#template_header_image,#header_wrapper{padding: 16px 10px 0 !important;}#header_wrapper h1{font-size: 24px !important;}#body_content_inner_cell{padding: 10px !important;}#body_content_inner{font-size: 12px !important;}.email-additional-content{padding-top: 16px !important;}}</style></head>\n	<body leftmargin=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" topmargin=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" offset=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #fff; padding: 0; text-align: center;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\n		<table width=\"100%\" id=\"outer_wrapper\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color: #fff;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\n			<tr>\n				<td><!-- Deliberately empty to support consistent sizing and layout across multiple email clients. --></td>\n				<td width=\"600\">\n					<div id=\"wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 0; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none;\" width=\"100%\">\n						<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"100%\" width=\"100%\" id=\"inner_wrapper\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color: #fff; border-radius: 8px;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\n							<tr>\n								<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\n																			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" role=\"presentation\">\n											<tr>\n												<td id=\"template_header_image\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 0;\">\n													<p class=\"email-logo-text\" style=\'color: #111; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left;\' align=\"left\">Matas Tactical Supply</p>												</td>\n											</tr>\n										</table>\n																		<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" id=\"template_container\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-shadow: none; background-color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 3px;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\n										<tr>\n											<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\n												<!-- Header -->\n												<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" id=\"template_header\" role=\"presentation\" style=\'background-color: #fff; color: #111; border-bottom: 0; font-weight: bold; line-height: 100%; vertical-align: middle; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;\' bgcolor=\"#fff\">\n													<tr>\n														<td id=\"header_wrapper\" style=\"padding: 20px 32px 0; display: block;\">\n															<h1 style=\'font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 120%; margin: 0; color: #111; background-color: inherit; text-align: left;\' bgcolor=\"inherit\">Welcome to Matas Tactical Supply</h1>\n														</td>\n													</tr>\n												</table>\n												<!-- End Header -->\n											</td>\n										</tr>\n										<tr>\n											<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\n												<!-- Body -->\n												<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" id=\"template_body\" role=\"presentation\">\n													<tr>\n														<td valign=\"top\" id=\"body_content\" style=\"background-color: #fff;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\n															<!-- Content -->\n															<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"20\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" role=\"presentation\">\n																<tr>\n																	<td valign=\"top\" id=\"body_content_inner_cell\" style=\"padding: 20px 32px 32px;\">\n																		<div id=\"body_content_inner\" style=\'color: #414141; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\' align=\"left\">\n\n<div class=\"email-introduction\" style=\"padding-bottom: 24px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px;\">Hi positivevibesforall94,</p>\n		<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px;\">Thanks for creating an account on Matas Tactical Supply. Here’s a copy of your user details.</p>\n	<div class=\"hr hr-top\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e; opacity: .2; margin: 16px 0; margin-top: 32px;\"></div>\n		<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px;\">Username: <b>positivevibesforall94</b></p>\n		<div class=\"hr hr-bottom\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e; opacity: .2; margin: 16px 0; margin-bottom: 32px;\"></div>\n	<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px;\">You can access your account area to view orders, change your password, and more via the link below:</p>\n	<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px;\"><a href=\"https://ghostwhite-flamingo-672332.hostingersite.com/my-account/\" style=\"color: #111; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: underline;\">My account</a></p>\n</div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" role=\"presentation\"><tr><td class=\"email-additional-content email-additional-content-aligned\" style=\'color: #111; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; padding: 32px 0 0;\'><p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0 0 16px;\" align=\"left\">We look forward to seeing you soon.</p>\n</td></tr></table>																		</div>\n																	</td>\n																</tr>\n															</table>\n															<!-- End Content -->\n														</td>\n													</tr>\n												</table>\n												<!-- End Body -->\n											</td>\n										</tr>\n									</table>\n								</td>\n							</tr>\n							<tr>\n								<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\n									<!-- Footer -->\n									<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" id=\"template_footer\" role=\"presentation\">\n										<tr>\n											<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 0; border-radius: 0;\">\n												<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" role=\"presentation\">\n													<tr>\n														<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"middle\" id=\"credit\" style=\'border-radius: 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 140%; text-align: center; padding: 32px; color: #111;\' align=\"center\">\n															<p style=\"margin: 0;\">Matas Tactical Supply<br>645 Elizabeth Avenue Elizabeth NJ, 07206, Elizabeth, AL 07206, United States (US)</p>\n														</td>\n													</tr>\n												</table>\n											</td>\n										</tr>\n									</table>\n									<!-- End Footer -->\n								</td>\n							</tr>\n						</table>\n					</div>\n				</td>\n				<td><!-- Deliberately empty to support consistent sizing and layout across multiple email clients. --></td>\n			</tr>\n		</table>\n	</body>\n</html>\n', 'Content-Type: text/html,\\nReply-to: Matas Tactical Supply <roy.sawan@gmail.com>', '', 'Could not instantiate mail function.', '1.15.0');
