(3268, 715, 'MetaID', '4403'),
(3269, 715, 'MetaKey', 'faq_11_content'),
(3270, 715, 'MetaValueNew', 'Firearms are NEVER shipped to someone’s home.  All firearms are shipped to an FFL per ATF regulations.  If your item is a non-firearm it will be shipped to the address you provide.  We ship via the USPS, FEDEx and UPS so please make sure that they will deliver to the address you provide.'),
