(3287, 717, 'MetaKey', 'faq_12_content'),
(3288, 717, 'MetaValueNew', 'Text and/or email notifications will be sent out a few minutes prior to the webinar going LIVE.  Only those who have purchased seats will be able to watch the webinar.  If you miss watching the LIVE webinar don’t worry, all webinars will be archived and can be viewed at your convenience. All webinar videos are saved in your account history. '),
