(3335, 723, 'MetaID', '4393'),
(3336, 723, 'MetaKey', 'faq_6_content'),
(3337, 723, 'MetaValueNew', 'Yes, we can ship anywhere in the US. We have shipped tactical items of all types throughout the US.    It is important to note that ALL firearms must be shipped to a federal firearms license (FFL) dealer.  If you do not already have one in your area just ask us, we have a couple thousand on file that we have shipped to previously.'),
(3338, 723, 'MetaValueOld', 'Yes, we can ship anywhere in the US.  We have shipped tactical items of all types throughout the US.    It is important to note that ALL firearms must be shipped to a federal firearms license (FFL) dealer.  If you do not already have one in your area just ask us, we have a couple thousand on file that we have shipped to previously.'),
